   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating the \"John M.\nGrassia III Memorial Bridge\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S6829",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6829-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §345-d, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S6829\n\nSPONSOR: FAHY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the highway law, in relation to designating the \"John M.\nGrassia III Memorial Bridge\"\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo honor the life and legacy of New York State Trooper John M. Grassia\nIII, who tragically lost his life on March 8, 2024, while serving as a\nNational Guard pilot.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: The highway law is amended by adding a new section naming the\nExit 25A ramp over the Thruway (I-90) after John M. Grassia III\n\nSection 2: This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nTrooper John M. Grassia III, at the young age of 30, tragically lost his\nlife during a federal mission with the National Guard when his helicop-\nter crashed near the southern border of Texas.\n\nTrooper Grassia began his service with the New York State Police on\nApril 4, 2022, and served with honor and distinction. His most recent\nassignment was with SP Livingston, Troop K, before transferring to SP\nFonda, Troop G, prior to his deployment.\n\nA dedicated public servant, Trooper Grassia embodied selflessness and\ncommitment, protecting the people of New York State and serving his\ncountry. His ultimate sacrifice serves as a solemn reminder of the cour-\nage and dedication of those who serve in uniform. This legislation seeks\nto honor his memory and ensure his contributions are never forgotten by\nnaming this bridge in his hometown in his honor.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
